        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>蒙台梭利 Montessori</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body{\n    margin:0;\n    background:#111;\n    display:flex;\n    justify-content:center;\n    font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Heiti SC\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  .slide{\n    position:relative;\n    width:540px;\n    min-height:720px;\n    background:#0a0a0a;\n    overflow:hidden;\n    color:#fff;\n  }\n  .placeholder{\n    position:absolute;\n    left:0;\n    width:100%;\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    color:#999;\n    font-size:12px;\n    letter-spacing:1px;\n  }\n  .photo-top{\n    top:0;\n    height:150px;\n    background:linear-gradient(#4a4a4a,#1c1c1c);\n  }\n  .photo-bottom{\n    bottom:0;\n    height:235px;\n    background:linear-gradient(#3d3122,#1a1510);\n  }\n  .dim-overlay{\n    position:absolute;\n    inset:0;\n    background:rgba(0,0,0,0.55);\n    z-index:1;\n  }\n  .content{\n    position:relative;\n    z-index:2;\n    padding:18px 14px 20px;\n    text-align:center;\n  }\n  .title{\n    font-size:32px;\n    font-weight:900;\n    margin:8px 0 22px;\n    letter-spacing:1px;\n  }\n  .line{\n    display:inline-block;\n    background:rgba(0,0,0,0.82);\n    padding:4px 10px;\n    border-radius:3px;\n    font-size:14.5px;\n    line-height:1.5;\n  }\n  .para-line{\n    display:block;\n    width:fit-content;\n    margin:3px auto;\n  }\n  .bullet-line{\n    display:block;\n    width:fit-content;\n    margin:6px auto;\n  }\n  .heading-line{\n    display:block;\n    width:fit-content;\n    margin:6px auto;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    font-size:16px;\n  }\n  .wave{\n    display:block;\n    width:75px;\n    height:10px;\n    margin:12px auto 4px;\n    border-bottom:3px solid #f2e94e;\n    border-bottom-style:wavy;\n    text-decoration:underline wavy #f2e94e 3px;\n  }\n  .u{\n    text-decoration:underline wavy #f2e94e 3px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"slide\">\n  <div class=\"placeholder photo-top\">[Photo: blurred portrait, top region]</div>\n  <div class=\"placeholder photo-bottom\">[Photo: wooden drawer cabinet with colorful items, bottom region]</div>\n  <div class=\"dim-overlay\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"title\">蒙台梭利Montessori</div>\n\n    <span class=\"line para-line\">蒙特梭利教学法并非一成不变，这种教学法是开放的，</span>\n    <span class=\"line para-line\">且建立在蒙特梭利教育哲学和精神之上。</span>\n    <span class=\"line para-line\">非常强调环境对儿童的影响，</span>\n    <span class=\"line para-line\">主张理想的教室必须具备以下五种要素：</span>\n\n    <span class=\"wave\"></span>\n    <span class=\"line heading-line\">1、自由的观念</span>\n\n    <span class=\"line bullet-line\">●儿童只有在自由、开放的环境下才能将学习发挥到极点</span>\n\n    <span class=\"wave\"></span>\n    <span class=\"line bullet-line\">●蒙特梭利并不赞同没有经过过滤的自由。</span>\n\n    <span class=\"line bullet-line\">●儿童可以依照自己的兴趣选择教具，</span>\n    <span class=\"line bullet-line\">也可以依照自己的喜好选择学习的地点及时间。</span>\n    <span class=\"line bullet-line\">●孩子之间可以相互观摩学习，是一种混龄式的教学。</span>\n\n    <span class=\"wave\"></span>\n    <span class=\"line bullet-line\">●废除传统教学中惯用的奖惩制度</span>\n\n    <span class=\"wave\"></span>\n    <span class=\"line heading-line\">2、结构与秩序</span>\n\n    <span class=\"line bullet-line\">●将教具按照其难度加以排列，<span class=\"u\">较有秩序及结构感</span>。</span>\n    <span class=\"line bullet-line\">●养成儿童<span class=\"u\">自动自发</span>，物归原处的生活习惯。</span>\n    <span class=\"line bullet-line\">●外在环境的结构只是为配合儿童的学习，</span>\n    <span class=\"line bullet-line\">教师们应视儿童的需要而适时更换教室的陈设，</span>\n    <span class=\"line bullet-line\">在有序中保持弹性。</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
